    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scionide</strong> is a fast-paced sci-fi action shooter set in the war-torn future of the <strong>Scion Conflict</strong> universe. In the year <strong>2268 AD</strong>, humanity is fractured. The <strong>Amalgamate Republic</strong>, a shattered alliance of frontier colony words fighting for freedom, makes its final stand against the <strong>Scion Empire</strong>, a militarized regime led by the ruthless <strong>Duntana</strong>, alien hybrid daughter of the Scion Emperor. As the war rages across the Milky Way, shadowy forces maneuver behind the scenes, seeking to seize control of humanity\u2019s destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in intense battles across diverse environments</strong>, whether in <strong>single-player, PvP, or co-op PvE</strong> modes. Play on expansive maps, fighting against AI or other players in adrenaline-fueled combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Single-player and multiplayer battles against AI or human opponents<br>\u2705 Multiple maps featuring dynamic environments<br>\u2705 Co-op PvE for team-based engagements against AI<br><br><strong>Future Roadmap:\u00a0</strong>Syonix plans to add mechs, vehicles, aircraft, tactical and strategic mechanics such as AI squad movement, and a grand strategy campaign on a galactic scale providing a diverse range of accessible human, alien, and sentient robotic factions to play as and play against.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Fight. Shape the Future. Scionide is based off the Scion Conflict 2267 AD book and universe by D.A Basque.</strong> <br><br> </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scionide</strong> is a fast-paced sci-fi action shooter set in the war-torn future of the <strong>Scion Conflict</strong> universe. In the year <strong>2268 AD</strong>, humanity is fractured. The <strong>Amalgamate Republic</strong>, a shattered alliance of frontier colony words fighting for freedom, makes its final stand against the <strong>Scion Empire</strong>, a militarized regime led by the ruthless <strong>Duntana</strong>, alien hybrid daughter of the Scion Emperor. As the war rages across the Milky Way, shadowy forces maneuver behind the scenes, seeking to seize control of humanity\u2019s destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in intense battles across diverse environments</strong>, whether in <strong>single-player, PvP, or co-op PvE</strong> modes. Play on expansive maps, fighting against AI or other players in adrenaline-fueled combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Single-player and multiplayer battles against AI or human opponents<br>\u2705 Multiple maps featuring dynamic environments<br>\u2705 Co-op PvE for team-based engagements against AI<br><br><strong>Future Roadmap:\u00a0</strong>Syonix plans to add mechs, vehicles, aircraft, tactical and strategic mechanics such as AI squad movement, and a grand strategy campaign on a galactic scale providing a diverse range of accessible human, alien, and sentient robotic factions to play as and play against.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Fight. Shape the Future. Scionide is based off the Scion Conflict 2267 AD book and universe by D.A Basque.</strong> <br><br> </h2>",
